   "doc": "Delivery and engagement of live mail by sending domain, stream, tag or mailbox provider, with rates and a time series. Requires a full-access key. Counts are recipients, except delayed, opened and clicked: unique emails. Delivery and bounce rates are of sent; complaint, open and click rates of delivered. Test-mode mail is excluded. Kept for 400 days. An out-of-band bounce (a later bounce email from the remote server) has no sending domain: it is grouped under an empty value. Totals and the series count each email once whatever the dimension; with dimension=tag an email with several tags appears in each of its tags' groups.",
