   "doc": "Upload an image for use in templates, as a multipart file or by URL; returns its public URL. Requires a full-access live key; test keys get 403 test_key_restricted. PNG, JPEG, GIF or WebP, up to 5 MB and 40 megapixels; the file content decides the type, not its name. PNG and JPEG images wider than 1,200 px are scaled down to 1,200 px (twice a 600 px email); GIF (animations included) and WebP are kept as they are. width and height are those of the stored image. The URL is public (anyone with it can load the image) and long-lived: use it in <img src> of any template. The name keeps letters, digits, spaces and . _ ( ) -, up to 200 characters. Each account holds up to 2,000 images and 1 GB.",
