   "summary": "Create a countdown timer image: an animated GIF that shows the time left whenever the email is opened.",
   "doc": "Create a countdown timer image: an animated GIF that shows the time left whenever the email is opened. Requires a full-access live key; test keys get 403 test_key_restricted. Nothing is stored: the URL carries the signed settings, so changing it breaks the image. Put it in an <img> of a template (the visual editor’s timer block does this for you). Each open renders one frame per second for a minute, then the last frame stays; after end it shows zeros. Renders are shared for 5 seconds, so a broadcast opened by many recipients at once costs one render.",
